    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know u say i should see someone but i dont have insurance and i really cant afford an ER visit right now. it feels more like a strain since i was lifting those boxes. if i just take like 800mg of ibuprofen every few hours for a couple days, do u think that would help more than waiting around? i'd rather just manage the pain at home if it's just a muscle thing.",
